// Pearl Causal do(X = x) Intervention Check vs Spurious Confounder Correlation
// Dataset A: Pure Confounder Z -> X and Z -> Y (Zero true X -> Y causal effect!)
// When Z=0: X=0 (9 times, Y=0), X=1 (1 time, Y=0) -> P(Y=1|Z=0,X=1)=0, P(Y=1|Z=0,X=0)=0
// When Z=1: X=1 (9 times, Y=1), X=0 (1 time, Y=1) -> P(Y=1|Z=1,X=1)=1, P(Y=1|Z=1,X=0)=1
// Observational P(Y=1|X=1) = 0.9 vs P(Y=1|X=0) = 0.1 (obs_diff = +0.80!), YET P(Y=1|do(X=1)) = 0.5 == P(Y=1|do(X=0)) -> ACE_do = 0.0!
